  "final_output": "**Decision Memo: Weekly Dependency Updates**\n\n**Recommendation**  \nMove dependency updates from a monthly to a weekly schedule.\n\n**Rationale**  \nWeekly updates will reduce the time known vulnerabilities remain in our codebase. Smaller, more frequent update batches should also make compatibility issues easier to identify and resolve.\n\n**Tradeoff**  \nThis change will increase the frequency of engineering review and testing. However, each review should be narrower than the current monthly batch, helping limit the added burden.\n\n**Approval Needed**  \nEngineering manager approval is requested to adopt the weekly schedule and allocate the required review capacity.",
